@@ .policy[11]
- NOC Engineer: sistem tiket Agent; monitoring read-only dan acknowledge alert; SIEM dan WAF read-only; console Nusagrid Operator; Acronis Operator; Jumphost sesuai aset yang ditugaskan; password manager collection tim sendiri; knowledge base sesuai peran tech-ops.
+ NOC Engineer: sistem ticket Agent; monitoring read-only dan acknowledge alert; SIEM dan WAF read-only; console Nusagrid Operator; Acronis Operator; Jumphost sesuai aset yang ditugaskan; password manager collection tim sendiri; knowledge base sesuai peran tech-ops.

@@ .policy[12]
- SOC Analyst: sistem tiket Agent; monitoring read-only; SIEM dan WAF Analyst; console Nusagrid read-only; Acronis read-only; Jumphost sesuai investigasi; password manager collection tim sendiri; knowledge base sesuai peran tech-ops.
+ SOC Analyst: sistem ticket Agent; monitoring read-only; SIEM dan WAF Analyst; console Nusagrid read-only; Acronis read-only; Jumphost sesuai investigasi; password manager collection tim sendiri; knowledge base sesuai peran tech-ops.

@@ .policy[13]
- Lead NOC dan Lead SOC: sistem tiket Group admin; monitoring Admin; SIEM dan WAF Admin; console Nusagrid Admin; Acronis Admin; Jumphost sesuai kebutuhan; password manager collection manager; knowledge base sesuai peran.
+ Lead NOC dan Lead SOC: sistem ticket Group admin; monitoring Admin; SIEM dan WAF Admin; console Nusagrid Admin; Acronis Admin; Jumphost sesuai kebutuhan; password manager collection manager; knowledge base sesuai peran.

@@ .policy[14]
